      "concept": {
        "id": "wbft-current-lock",
        "kind": "rule",
        "definition": "The WBFT Core's `current` round-state pointer is guarded by\n`currentMutex` (consensus/wbft/core/core.go:106 — a sync.RWMutex).\nEvery accessor that reads `c.current` MUST hold currentMutex.RLock\n(read) or currentMutex.Lock (write). Examples in-repo: the\ncurrent-proposal accessor at core.go:155-157 acquires RLock around\nthe read; the round-state mutator at core.go:162-166 acquires\nLock for the entire write region.",
        "includes": [
          "WBFT Core lock discipline — never read Core.current off currentMutex"
        ],
